msgctxt "168"
msgid "Thank you for coming, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, we can't release her until she pays for both her check and "
"the damage she did to some of our glassware... The total comes out to "
"300,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>300,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry you have to do this. I don't mean to butt into your personal "
"life, but this girl clearly has a problem with alcohol. You may want to "
"reconsider your friendship with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"I've got to get back to work. Thank you again.\r\n"
"Come on, let's go clean up that mess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Sorry, I don't have the cash on me right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, sir, but you really need to get that money to us. She's still "
"out cold, and we can't have her lying around the club much longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "I'll pay it, don't worry. Wait here, I'll be back with your 300 grand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Thank you, but please, if you could hurry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Heeeeeey! Kazuma Kiryuuu! Yer sooooo late! I waited foreeeeever for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "...What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Ahahaha! Oh, Kiryu-san, I looooove you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "You're... very drunk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"This has been quite the ordeal... She got more and more intoxicated, then "
"began trashing our club. All of our other customers ran off because of her "
"tantrum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"The club owner said we shouldn't bother you about it, because you helped "
"him out in the past..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"But we can't let her leave without getting reimbursed for the damage she "
"did to our club tonight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Heeeey! I, like, said I'd pay, riiiiiiight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Say it all you want, but you don't have any money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "That's why we had to call Kiryu-san to come bail you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "How much does she owe you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Her check and the damage she did to the club comes out to a total of "
"300,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>300,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry you have to do this. I don't mean to butt into your personal "
"life, but this girl clearly has a problem with alcohol. You may want to "
"reconsider your friendship with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "I've got to get back to work. Thank you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Come on, let's go clean up that mess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Yes, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't have enough cash right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "That's a bit of a problem..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Could you wait a little longer? I'll be back once I have the 300 grand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "I suppose we'll have to. We'll let her sleep in the club for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Sorry about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "I'll pay off her tab."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
